# Universal AI Skills

Universal AI Skills are platform-independent capabilities that apply across every modern AI system.

Whether someone uses ChatGPT, Claude, Microsoft Copilot, Cursor or another AI assistant, these are the fundamental skills required to work effectively, safely and consistently.

## Purpose

The goal of this repository is not to teach individual tools.

The goal is to build transferable AI capabilities.

## Platforms

- ChatGPT
- Claude
- Microsoft Copilot
- Cursor
- GitHub Copilot

